// ============================================================================
// LIB: IB EVENT LOG HELPER
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Must be #include'd at FORMULA TOP LEVEL (never inside if/else/for).
// AmiBroker rejects `function` definitions inside compound statements.
//
// PROVIDES:
//   IbLogEvt(evtPfx, evtMsg) — append a line to the per-symbol IB event log
// ============================================================================

function IbLogEvt(evtPfx, evtMsg)
{
    evtKey  = evtPfx + "EvtLog";
    evtPrev = StaticVarGetText(evtKey);
    StaticVarSetText(evtKey, StrLeft(evtMsg + "\n" + evtPrev, 500));
}
